# Planning documents are working artifacts and are never committed — including
# the cross-repo ones. They are written here and read from a sibling checkout by
# relative path (../aitp-control-plane/plans/cross-repo/...), which needs no
# blob URL. An issue in another repo that wants the content should quote it
# rather than link to it.
